# Inputs of requirements/image.txt: what backend/Dockerfile installs into the
# backend image (no dev tools). Re-lock after editing this file or any
# pyproject.toml it names:  python3 scripts/py_lock.py relock
# The local packages are built from the checkout (not editable) with
# --no-build-isolation, so hatchling comes from this lock. pip is locked because
# the image's virtual environment keeps it.
pip
hatchling
./packages/causal-core
./packages/causal-decision
./backend[production]

